  "details": "Yesterday I logged in for the Halloween parties around. Havent been online in FBT since like 2 weeks, if I remember well (just vr I have been but mostly of the problems don't affect me). Read about people having issues with the update.\nMy avatars: (FBT) \n3.0 recently uploaded\n3.0 uploaded before patch \n2.0 that I have since long uploaded\nwere having issues with visemes (animations), i wasnt able to change my hand gesture from 🖐️ to anything different at least locally and in 3.0 cases also for everyone.\nPlus when I jump, my neck/ chest and hip stretch not incredible much but still stretch, maybe as much as an extra neck, Idk if that could be locally or not.\nTried to fix all said above, couldn't so I maybe thus help for reporting at least, will wait for next week parties to check it.",
